      ],
      "explanation": "ISO 45001:2018第9條為「績效評估（Performance evaluation）」，包括監督、量測、分析及評估、內部稽核、管理審查。對應PDCA循環之Check（檢查）階段。",
      "references": [
        {
          "title": "ISO 45001:2018",
          "url": "https://www.iso.org/standard/63787.html"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "U11-Q010",
      "type": "single_choice",
      "difficulty": "intermediate",
      "stem": "ISO 45001:2018 中，第10條規定之內容為何？",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "營運"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "績效評估"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "改善"
        },
